# RAG Group Project Rules

Read these files before coding:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `group_project/docs/project-brief.md`
- `group_project/docs/page-index.md`
- `group_project/docs/qwen-api.md`
- `group_project/docs/codex-vibe-coding-guide.md`

Keep the implementation simple and demo-ready.

Rules:

- Do not hard-code API keys or model names.
- Read Qwen config from `.env`: `QWEN_API_KEY`, `QWEN_BASE_URL`, `QWEN_MODEL_NAME`.
- Read PageIndex config from `.env`: `PAGEINDEX_API_KEY`.
- PageIndex should upload only the 3 legal PDF files listed in `group_project/docs/page-index.md`.
- Qwen answers must be based on retrieved context and include citation `[Source, Year]`.
- If evidence is missing, return `I cannot verify this information`.
- Do not change unit tests unless explicitly asked.
- After coding, run a small smoke test or the relevant pytest command.

